<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53824" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταγρᾰφ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drawing, delineation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς σφαίρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					3.60
				</span></i>
			; <i>drawing of maps</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Geog.</u>
				1.2.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιεῖσθαι τὴν τῆς οἰκουμένης
			κ</span>. ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.4
			</span></i>; of the celestial globe, <i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				5.45
			</span></i>; <i>diagram, figure</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				18.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Cael.</u>
				652.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>delineation in profile</i>, in bas-relief, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐν ταῖς στήλαις καταγραφὴν
					ἐκτετυπωμένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					193a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>marking out</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς Χώρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					8.69
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>engraving</i> of an inscription, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Abh.Berl.Akad.</u>
				1925(5).21
			</span></i> (Cyrene, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>list, register</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνομάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.492b
				</span></i>
			 (pl.); esp. <i>roll of soldiers</i>, in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.24.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				4.19
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῶν συνέδρων κ</span>. the
				<i>roll</i> of the Senate, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				20.36
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>conveyance</i> of land or houses, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1131i21
			</span></i> (Aug.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				306
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Annuario</u>
				4
			</span></i>/<i><span class="en">
				5.469
			</span></i> (Halic.), etc.; also of slaves, etc., <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1114
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Charito
				1.14
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
